<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs $1.00-1.50 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs $1.00-1.50 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $1.00-1.50 higher. Demand good. Top $59.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 lbs.  57.00-58.00, few 58.50-59.00</p>
<p>US 2-3  230-260 lbs.  55.50-57.00</p>
<p>Sows: Under 500 lbs. steady to 1.00 lower, over 500 lbs. steady</p>
<p>to 1.00 higher. Top 51.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-400 lbs.  43.00-45.00</p>
<p>	  400-500 lbs.  45.00-47.00</p>
<p>	  500-600 lbs.  47.00-50.00</p>
<p>	 over 600 lbs.  49.00-51.00</p>
</text>
